<title>UK: CSW Investments sets 100 mln stg 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>CSW Investments sets 100 mln stg 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BZW and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CSW INVESTMENTS</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    27.SEP.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    27.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+85 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA2	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.45	SELL CONC  1.55	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.50 PERCENT 2006 GILTS</p>
<p> NOTES    * CSW INVESTMENTS IS THE ACQUISITIONS HOLDING COMPANY</p>
<p>		OF SEEBOARD PLC, A PRIVATISED REGIONAL</p>
<p>		ELECTRICITY COMPANY</p>
<p>	    * ISSUER CALL OPTION AT ANY TIME</p>
<p>	    * PUT OPTION IF LESS THAN 51 PCT OWNERSHIP BY SEEBOARD</p>
<p>		OR STANDARD RESTRUCTURING EVENT RELATING TO SEEBOARD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
